  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Bullet Chart is a variation of a bar chart that is used to compare a primary measure against one or more other measures within a defined context, such as a target value or qualitative performance range. It supports horizontal and vertical orientations, multiple data ranges (poor, satisfactory, good), comparative measures, and feature measures. Ideal for KPI dashboards, performance tracking, and business intelligence reporting applications built with ASP.NET Core.",
